# pond: a day.                              ./pond --script demos/day.pond
#
# The sun is a parameter.  Sweep its elevation and the light, the sky, the
# glints and the caustics follow: long grazing glints at dawn, a red Fresnel
# dusk, then the moon, sparse glints and stars.  The pool sits in its
# setting, so the house's shadow swings across the terrace and the water
# through the day, and its rooms light up at night.  Minutes, on a loop: a
# screen saver.

at 0     clear  shape rect  preset pool  rain off  paddle off  boat off  floats 0  glass 0  setting house
at 0     breeze on  breeze-gain 0.4
at 0     sun-azim 110  sun-elev -12
at 0     camera 10,16,1.5
at 0     say "night.  the moon on the water"
at 15    sun-elev 4 over 40
at 15    say "dawn: low sun on the house front, long glints on the water"
at 30    say ""
at 40    yaw += 50 over 120
at 55    sun-elev 60 over 70   sun-azim 200 over 70
at 60    say "noon"
at 125   say ""
at 130   sun-elev 2 over 60   sun-azim 260 over 60
at 150   say "evening: the sun behind the house, its shadow across the pool"
at 190   sun-elev -15 over 30
at 200   say "and night again"
at 230   say ""
at 235   loop
